    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d43-f1" n="1" xml:id="d43-f1-content">
                <p>For texts of NSC 20/4, “U.S. Objectives With Respect to the USSR To Counter
                    Soviet Threats to U.S. Security”, Nov. 23, 1948, see <ref
                        target="frus1948v01p2#pg_662"><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1948, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, Part 2, p.
                        662</ref>; NSC 68/2, “United States Objectives and Programs for National
                    Security”, Sept. 30, 1950, see <ref target="frus1950v01#pg_400"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., 1950, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >i</hi>, p. 400</ref>; NSC 135/3, “Reappraisal of U.S. Objectives and
                    Strategy for National Security”, Sept. 25, 1952, see <ref target="#pg142">p.
                        142</ref>; NSC 141, “Reexamination of United States Programs for National
                    Security”, Jan. 19, 1953, see <ref target="#pg209">p. 209</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
